```java
if (entitledTestPackages == null || entitledTestPackages.length == 0) {
    this.entitledTestPackages = TEST_FRAMEWORK_PACKAGE_PREFIXES;
    return;
}
```
The assertion in the rule is redundant but not harmful — it catches the error earlier with a clearer message.

